# Auction module only

Until the user explicitly lifts this, work **only** on the Auction module.

**Basic Auction** = local device-only (manual Sold + price + captain; persist on Save only — no per-click cloud). Other kinds are **cloud-backed live**. **Simple Auction** = creator-only live rounds. **Advance Auction** = creator + captains enter with a per-captain code (Joker + Blind Bid). No extra auction admins. **Simple Drafting** = creator picks round-by-round (no wallet). **Advance Drafting** = same picking + player groups with a max per captain per group. Creator sets captain pick order once; that sequence is used for the whole draft.

